 faq2=[('Can EcoShort-GS-777 be used with my existing size?','It is designed to replace PVA powder. Whether other recipe items stay is decided during the trial.'),('Is EcoShort-GS-777 used only in sizing?','It is used in sizing and dyeing applications as a replacement for PVA powders.'),('How is EcoShort-GS-777 supplied?','As a white thick paste in 125–240 KG packs.')],
